{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > City builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your truck fleet, build your city and design a supply chain to extract, refine and process natural resources into complex items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/2635bd28ee4747ef3c02def855fd23d7.poster.avif?t=1764693250\" width=640 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/2635bd28ee4747ef3c02def855fd23d7.webm?t=1764693250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/2635bd28ee4747ef3c02def855fd23d7.mp4?t=1764693250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logistics manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up the priority of your factories, manage your trucks, carefully design your roads to prevent traffic jams. Sell your surpluses to earn money to continue growing your city. Buy missing resources or automate the production of complex items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/b2c92ea589b81e0c5a8f7f57b2ad64f0.poster.avif?t=1764693250\" width=640 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/b2c92ea589b81e0c5a8f7f57b2ad64f0.webm?t=1764693250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/b2c92ea589b81e0c5a8f7f57b2ad64f0.mp4?t=1764693250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new research and improve your trucks stats, optimize factory throughput and efficiency, and minimize truck loading and unloading times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/2dfe7c151f3b9133f93b1d13215be50c.poster.avif?t=1764693250\" width=640 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/2dfe7c151f3b9133f93b1d13215be50c.webm?t=1764693250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812200/extras/2dfe7c151f3b9133f93b1d13215be50c.mp4?t=1764693250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Astronaut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/9ef1837e301ecccccb2617739293ecee39d32d8f.jpg"},{"name":"Scrap dealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/2bd06497732dafe6ba3f98618cc4cabe0d94f912.jpg"},{"name":"Curonian Spit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/5e556d3393c635ea197abf48dc453ce641964146.jpg"},{"name":"Oil & Space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/2a145e770d3f41b1e456efa4421a4a614c64a248.jpg"},{"name":"Banker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/3b0aba501fda318522bdb2c6a5609f17c2d71f91.jpg"},{"name":"Exporter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/f422ad3008476ebe006751bb71464bee0277e7d9.jpg"},{"name":"War Logistics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/65280d612e25384a85fd8d892136d10dc15771fb.jpg"},{"name":"High Tech","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812200/8a66acf5f5e6f5a69e915af09bf1e0b30d969bfd.jpg"},{"n